Z||000010||theogre||02-02-2001||07:42 PM||||The new round light looks nice.<P>Please, don't compare light output based on lamp shape. Shape doesn't really have much to do with the usefull light comming from them. Difernent brands/types of 6054 will have diferent apparent light output even with the same wattage lamp in them. Same holds true for all other form factors. ||||reg||1
